+/// Take the oldest unread deferred message, or reset the list once all are read.
+/// Removing from the front would shift the whole backlog per message, quadratic in
+/// what a teardown collects. The head moves before the caller processes the message:
+/// a close inside processMessage runs TeardownDrain.start, which filters from the head.
+fn nextDeferred(self: *App) ?Message {
